    "source_excerpt": "It is not known if venlafaxine can make it harder to get pregnant. There are a few reports of women having higher levels of the hormone prolactin while taking venlafaxine. High levels of prolactin can stop ovulation (part of the menstrual cycle when an ovary releases an egg). Stopping ovulation can make it harder to get pregnant."
